      "backlog_current_blocker": "condensed_translation_needs_expansion",
      "backlog_remediation_action": "expand_existing_internal_chinese_from_arabic",
      "remediated_chinese_text": "股份公司应设有代表已认购股份的已发行资本；公司基本章程可规定授权资本。\n经公司董事会决议，可在授权资本限度内增加已发行资本，但以已发行资本已全额缴清为前提。",
      "remediated_chinese_text_hash_sha256": "6660b48a480a632731fbcf11ecdf3c0e7adb4f269e0cabf7d038f546671ef617",
      "internal_reference_only": true,
